values ('ahu', 'جامعة الحسين بن طلال', 'Al-Hussein Bin Talal University', 'معان', 'public', array['ahu.edu.jo']::text[], 30.2598, 35.6753, 'draft', 'LOW CONFIDENCE. ahu.edu.jo (and admhec.gov.jo) block automated fetching (robots), so no page content could be read. College names are verbatim from official page titles (''أهلاً بكم في كلية ...''); majors are derived from official department page titles (''أهلاً بكم في قسم ...'', CollDeptAr.aspx) plus the 2025/26 new-programmes announcement (AHU article 47278/47333, read via Assawsana and Nesan mirrors). Department-to-college mapping and department-vs-major equivalence were cross-checked against a third-party list (dirasaabroad.com) and are not verified on the official site. Specific doubts: business dept page is ''المحاسبة والعلوم المالية والمصرفية'' (one dept, two majors assumed: المحاسبة / العلوم المالية والمصرفية); ''إدارة الأعمال'' is supported only by an official study-plan file title; Islamic Studies and International Relations are placed in Arts per the third-party list; Medical Analysis and Radiography had department pages (historically under the Nursing college per third party) and were placed under the new ''كلية العلوم الطبية المساندة'' (established 2025, which hosts the new Physical Therapy programme) — placement unverified. The three engineering-technology programmes are ''برنامج تقني'' bachelor''s listed under Engineering by the announcement, although a new ''الكلية التقنية'' (ar-college-7062) was also created in 2025 and may host them. Law has public/private law departments; single major ''القانون'' per third party. Not included because unverified on the official site: معلم الصف، رياض الأطفال/تربية الطفل، التربية الخاصة، علم المكتبات، هندسة الاتصالات، الهندسة البيئية، التسويق، إدارة المكاتب، التأمين وإدارة المخاطر، الإدارة السياحية، الإرشاد السياحي. Educational Sciences has a ''المناهج و التدريس'' department but its bachelor majors could not be confirmed. Cybersecurity may be named ''الأمن السيبراني والحوسبة السحابية'' (hala.jo wording). Email: only the domain ahu.edu.jo is evident; no student subdomain verified, no webmail/portal URL verified (psa.ahu.edu.jo is the graduate-studies admissions portal, not included). Coordinates from latitude.to (consistent with Wikipedia''s ''9 km NW of Ma''an''), not OSM. Wikipedia lists colours goldenrod and white; no hex verified.')
