values ('mutah', 'جامعة مؤتة', 'Mutah University', 'الكرك', 'public', array['mutah.edu.jo']::text[], 31.0936, 35.7173, 'draft', 'Majors list = the 61 civilian-wing bachelor programmes in Mutah''s official 2025/2026 bachelor list (Admission & Registration Unit, dated 24/08/2025, Majors2025.pdf). That PDF''s Arabic text extracts with corrupted glyphs (font ligature issue); Arabic names were decoded character-by-character and cross-checked against the university''s Arabic brochure, so treat spelling (hamzas, ال) as near-exact rather than byte-exact. The PDF writes ''الفقة وأصوله'' (typo) – brochure spelling ''الفقه وأصوله'' used. Code 2211 extracted as ''الحاسوب''; named ''علم الحاسوب'' per the faculty''s 2025 study-plan title. Faculty-to-major mapping is from the university brochure/Handbook (the 2025 list is grouped but its faculty headings did not extract); Dentistry faculty''s exact Arabic name not verified (''كلية طب الأسنان'' per an official announcement title; brochure text suggests ''كلية طب وجراحة الفم والأسنان''). English names are mostly translations; only some match the English Academic Programs Handbook (2024). Older programmes in the 2024 brochure but absent from the 2025 list (e.g. Cosmetics/Cosmetology at Pharmacy, Sports Training, Marketing, Public/Private Law tracks, Child Education & Kindergarten, Applied Psychology) were left out; current students in them may still exist. Military wing (Faculty of Military Sciences, Faculty of Police Sciences, etc.) programmes are not included – not part of civilian admission and their faculty/degree mapping was unclear. Email: student address format is <university number>@mutah.edu.jo per the E-Learning Center FAQ (Teams + Outlook used); no separate student subdomain found. Portal and registration links are plain http as published by the university. Library link not included (official page pointed ''Electronic Library'' to regweb.mutah.edu.jo/menu, which looked mislabelled). Centre coordinates are from Wikipedia (German) 31°5′36.8″N 35°43′2.2″E, not verified on OSM. Brand colour not found. admhec.gov.jo could not be read (robots-disallowed).')
