values ('ttu', 'جامعة الطفيلة التقنية', 'Tafila Technical University', 'الطفيلة', 'public', array['ttu.edu.jo','stu.ttu.edu.jo']::text[], null, null, 'draft', 'Bachelor majors are verbatim from the official tuition-fees page (Admission & Registration dept), which may still list programmes that are closed to new admission (e.g. ''العلوم الاساسية'', ''التربية'', and both ''هندسة الميكاترونيكس'' and ''هندسة الميكاترونيكس والروبوتات''). The academics page states counts of 16 engineering / 9 science / 6 education / 7 business / 2 arts / 4 IT bachelor programmes (44 total, though the same page also says 33 bachelor programmes overall). The English engineering page also lists ''Electrical Power & Control Engineering'' and ''Air Conditioning and Refrigeration Technology'', whose Arabic names were not found, so they are omitted. Diplomas: only the 6 intermediate-diploma specialisations shown on the academics page under ''الكلية التقنية المتوسطة'' are included; the fee page lists ~40 diploma names (many likely historical) and the site says 13 intermediate-diploma specialisations exist. Email: students use [StudentID]@stu.ttu.edu.jo (stated on the student-services page); staff domain ttu.edu.jo. The Teams link on the site is a long login.microsoftonline.com OAuth URL redirecting to teams.microsoft.com/v2, simplified here. Campus centre coordinates could not be verified (campus is in Al-Eis district on the hills overlooking Tafila, ~1251 m altitude), so lat/lng are null. Brand colour not verified. English names for engineering majors are from the official English page; others are translations.')
